   "body": "Thanks for the quick fix!\n\nI can confirm that the Tencent Cloud International Guangzhou endpoint (`https://tokenhub.tencentcloudmaas.com/v1`) works with my International account API key. I've successfully used GLM-5.3 through Magpie using a custom provider configuration and received HTTP 200 responses.\n\nThis validates the endpoint with a real International account key, though I haven't tested the new `intl-gz` preset itself yet.\n\nThanks for adding support for this region!",
